Netflix is increasing its prices, with all plans set to get &#36;1 to &#36;2 more expensive. The ad-supported plan is now &#36;8.99 per month, up from &#36;7.99/month, while the Standard plan is &#36;19.99 per month, up from &#36;17.99 per month. Netflix's most expensive Premium plan is &#36;26.99 per month, up from &#36;24.99 per month. Extra member add-on pricing is also increasing by &#36;1.<br/>
<br/>
